 "level_notes": {
  "1": "Statecharts were defined by Harel (1987) with several later semantics (STATEMATE, UML); SCXML 1.0 is the W3C Recommendation that fixes a concrete XML syntax and an executable interpretation algorithm (Appendix D).",
  "0": "Open implementations include Apache Commons SCXML (Java) and XState (TypeScript, SCXML-inspired statecharts)."
 },
